    description: "Audit-findings property test (packages/hypergumbo-core/tests/test_audit_findings.py) currently validates the structural shape of each row's diagnostic_test field but does not execute the cmd. Extend the test so that for every verdict with verdict=DEPRECATE-NO-FOLD, the diagnostic_test.cmd is executed and its stdout matches the expect field (typically 'empty', meaning no producer emits the value). This catches the regression class where a producer is added later for a value flagged DEPRECATE-NO-FOLD without updating the verdict. Per the Fundamental Concept Audit playbook §'Step 4.5 — Indirection-aware producer trace' as amended on 2026-05-07. Per ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/notebookjournal_05072026_0316.md §'High-value (file as tracker items) #3'."  # e3de
